"P3024430404" "Targeted AoE, Extreme DMG(Smashing), Moderate DoT(Fire), +DMG, +DEF (Smashing), Knockback, Stun"
// Power Help Text :
"P217657654" "You call down a meteor strike from the sky at a single target's location. All targets around the main target within 30' are caught in the blast radius. In addition to a knockback in the entire radius, those in the inner 15' of the radius suffer the worst effects, including more damage and a stun, while those in the outer radius suffer less damage and no stun. This power also increases your smashing damage and defense for a brief time."
