"P2060357551" "DoT(Fire or Cold), Special"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3788711341" "You are affected by a seasonal shift around a Diviner. Depending on your distance from the Diviner when this attack is used, you will suffer either fire damage over time and a reduction in your chance to hit or cold damage and reduced movement and attack speeds."
