// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Curse 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3945760502" "Curse"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3451490917" "Ranged, Minor DMG (Energy), Minor DoT(Negative Energy), -RES(Heal,Foe), -Rech(Foe), -ToHit(Foe), -Range(Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1057419618" "You place a curse on your target, darkening their soul and weakening their body. The target suffers energy and negative energy damage, as well as a reduction in their combat speed, chance to hit, range and healing effectiveness."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2203276213" "-Heal, -Rech, -ToHit, -Range"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2001212807" "You have been weakened."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3193018659" "{PlayerSource} places a {PowerName} upon you, causing {Damage} points of energy damage and weakening you."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3741296277" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} causes an additional {Damage} points of negative energy damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Condemnation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1045916292" "Condemnation"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3938276542" "Targeted AoE, Moderate DMG(Energy), Minor DoT (Negative Energy), Chance for Fear(Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1207337083" "You speak words of condemnation while coalescing a mass of dark energy between your hands. When complete, you hurl this mass at your target, striking them with the full fury of your words. The target suffers energy and negative energy damage, and may be terrified by the force of your condemnation."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P332045248" "Fear"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4260876864" "You are afraid and find combat action more difficult."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2159906006" "{PlayerSource} issues forth a {PowerName}, causing {Damage} points of energy damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P705532890" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} strikes fear in your heart!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Castigation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3213186380" "Castigation"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P531270007" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Energy), Minor DoT(Negative Energy), -Regen(Foe), -Rec(Foe), -Def(Foe,All), -Res(Foe, All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P271203906" "You speak vicious words of castigation at the opponents arrayed before you. These words have a debilitating effect on the morale of afflicted targets. In addition to sustaining negative energy and energy damage, your targets suffer from reduced regeneration, recovery, defense and resistance."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P327822722" "-Regen, -Rec, -DEF(All), -RES(All)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3336769681" "Your regeneration, recovery, defense and resistance have been reduced."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1352947079" "{PlayerSource} assaults you with words of {PowerName}, causing {Damage} points of energy damage and reducing your protection against damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P699639597" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} reduces your regeneration and recovery."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Lamentation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3096135527" "Lamentation"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2210037598" "PBAoE, High DMG(Energy), Moderate DoT(Negative Energy), -DMG(Foe,All), Chance for Heal(Self) and +EndCost(Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3819632221" "You cry out in a sorrowful lamentation, causing energy and negative energy damage in those around you. There is a chance that your lamentations affect your enemy so deeply that you may feed upon their suffering, healing yourself and increasing the endurance cost of their powers."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3305480933" "-DEF(All), -RES(All), -Regen, -Rec"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1959451890" "Your defenses, resistances, regeneration and recovery have been reduced."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4191011905" "{PlayerSource} calls out in a wail of{PowerName}, causing {Damage} points of energy damage and reducing your damage potential."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2394791736" "{PlayerSource} 's {PowerName} also causes an additional {Damage} points of negative energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P103906993" "{PlayerSource}'s feeds upon the deep sorrow invoked within you by her {PowerName}, healing herself and increasing the endurance cost of your powers."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Siren 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P441095436" "Siren"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fascinating Song 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P420707891" "Fascinating Song"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1622111278" "Ranged, High DMG (Energy), Immobilize(Foe), -ToHit(Foe), -Recharge(Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P592803786" "You create a song which fascinates your target, infecting their mind with a distraction while you cause them harm. The target suffers energy damage from the song, while the fascination immobilizes them and reduces both their recharge and their chance to hit."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P164816770" "Immobilize, -ToHit, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1252872260" "You are fascinated. You have been immobilized and both your recharge and chance to hit have been reduced."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1600328035" "{PlayerSource} catches your attention with a {PowerName}, causing {Damage} points of energy damage and reducing your combat effectiveness."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1747117755" "You have been immobilized by {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Exhausting Song 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1566315144" "Exhausting Song"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1516403602" "Ranged, Superior DMG (Energy), Moderate DoT (Lethal), Chance for Heal (Self)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3283450712" "You create a song which exhausts your target, draining the very life out of their bodies. The target suffers energy damage, followed by lethal damage over time. There is a small chance this life energy is returned to you."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3278563378" "DoT(Lethal)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3081392166" "You are suffering from lethal damage over time."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2877708690" "{PlayerSource} assaults you with an {PowerName}, causing {Damage} points of energy damage and potentially healing herself."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1850761870" "You suffer an additional {Damage} points of lethal damage from wounds caused by {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Painful Song 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3407841281" "Painful Song"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P475256675" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG (Energy), Moderate DoT (Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P643685575" "You focus your energy to create pain in the mind of your target with song, causing energy damage. The pain caused is so excruciating that the target's mind makes it real, also causing them to suffer from wounds that inflict lethal damage over time."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1694639310" "{PlayerSource} inflicts a {PowerName} upon you, wracking your mind for {Damage} points of energy damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Forceful Song 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1711817521" "Forceful Song"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2983160574" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG (Smashing), Moderate DoT (Lethal), Chance for Knockdown(Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3265833403" "You gather your energy into a powerful, hard song, which crashes into your targets with great force. The impact causes smashing damage, some lethal damage over time and has the potential to knock affected targets off their feet."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3307125478" "{PlayerSource} lashes out with a {PowerName}, striking you for {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P48474706" "You have been knocked off your feet by {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sorrowful Song 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3724260676" "Sorrowful Song"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3903216088" "Ranged, High DoT (Energy), -Regen(Foe), -Rec(Foe), -Def(Foe,All), -Res(Foe, All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P4093192251" "You serenade your targets with a song of woe and sorrow, drawing them into a well of depression. This causes the target to suffer energy damage. Additionally, the targets are afflicted with a loss of their will to live, which manifests in reductions to their regeneration, recovery, defense and resistance."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1735494576" "{PlayerSource} demoralizes you with a {PowerName}, causing {Damage} points of energy damage and reducing your protection against damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1362357048" "You continue to suffer {Damage} points of energy damage from {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Seductive Song 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3251374927" "Seductive Song"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2416064147" "PBAoE, Minor DMG (Energy), Placate (Foe), Hide (Self)"
// Power Help Text :
"P96249276" "You enchant your targets with a song of beauty and promise, with the intent of luring them to their death. Any targets around you are enthralled by your song, and suffer energy damage. The seductiveness of the song leaves your target placated, even as you harm them, and allows you to withdraw to use your other songs."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1943041994" "Placate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P705818675" "You have been placated."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1314428180" "{PlayerSource} sings a {PowerName}, luring you into her deadly grasp and causing {Damage} points of energy damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1260622330" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} has placated you, preventing you from acting against her."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Debilitating Song 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3794767003" "Debilitating Song"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1411693671" "Targeted AoE, High DMG (Smashing/Energy), -DEF(Foe,All), -Rech(Foe), -ToHit(Foe), -Movement(Foe,Jump,Fly), Chance for Knockdown(Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2135691567" "You unleash a song which can crumble the earth itself, generating a powerful, localized earthquake that causes liquefaction of the ground. The impact of the sonic shockwave deals some minor damage and causes most targets to fall down. The violent shaking also reduces their chance to hit and defense."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P909040765" "{PlayerSource} calls out with a {PowerName}, with the power to liquefy the very earth on which you stand!"

