"P3325451245" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Lethal), DoT(Toxic), -DEF(Foe, All), Chance for Hold(Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2146784460" "You fire toxic quills at your target. These cause lethal damage on impact and inject a toxin that causes toxic damage over time while also lowering defenses. The toxins can stiffen muscles, holding the target in place."
