"P3070730662" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Lethal), Moderate DoT(Toxic) +EndCost(Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2400223516" "You fire toxic quills at your target. These cause lethal damage on impact and inject a toxin that causes toxic damage over time. The toxins can reduce strength, causing each action a target takes to cost more endurance."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1372992642" "DoT(Toxic), +EndCost"
