"P1840988276" "Exhausting Venom"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P42966982" "Ranged, Minor DMG (Psionic), Minor DoT (Toxic), -RES(Foe, All), -DEF (Foe, All), -Regen, -Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P1898584653" "You envenom your foe with a powerful poison. This poison deals only minor toxic damage, but the nerves of the body suffer failure. The target takes additional psionic damage from this, along with reductions in regeneration, healing effectiveness, resistance and defense."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
