"P1123042445" "Ranged, Minor DMG (Psionic), Minor DoT(Toxic), -DMG(Foe, All), -ToHit(Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P275115764" "You envenom your foe with a powerful poison. This poison deals only minor toxic damage, but the muscles of the body are weakened. This causes minor lethal damage, but also reduces the target's chance to hit and damage potential."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1464624322" "DoT(Toxic), -DMG(All), -ToHit"
